	(text "+5V_PM: the Pro Micro's RAW (~4.8 V from\nthe USB through its own Schottky). JP951\nopen; close only to run the tool from the\nUSB-C (500 mA, 9 V off). With 9 V on as\nwell: harmless, the board's diode blocks."
