	(text "GP6 high = the NPN conducts = the Melzi pin low = OK. A touch, a dead\nMCU (100k holds the base low) or a cut wire: the Melzi's pull-up\n(R401, sheet Melzi) wins = triggered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 317.5 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ffe82fe4-89d5-41cf-9279-b65fdf528bfa")
	)
	(text "POWER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8040f98d-b5af-41a3-9964-1c9ec5c958f9")
	)
	(text "The board: its USB-C to the Pi (+3V3_PH = E+), alive through tool faults.\nThe tool: J958 5 V in -> U953 + F951 -> +5V_TOOL on CAT6 #2. Its return and\nthe USB GND meet the board GND at the Pro Micro only; the 2 A off the rails."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b3490ffd-f6e7-420d-8de0-41a05bdcc9e1")
	)
	(text "THE BRIDGE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 218.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3db116b5-cfdc-4d6f-8cb2-574fd39de84c")
	)
	(text "One full bridge, closed at the gauges: orange = E, blue = S.\nGreen: the tool's ID + the QRE's output, brown: the QRE's 3V3/GND.\nSign and grams on the bench; diag() noise with a tool going on and off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 110.49 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8c8d1aef-8809-4af2-9bed-e429f595e3f4")
	)
	(text "THE ADC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 198.12 218.44 0)
		(effects
